# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of each contributor's platform or local core.autocrlf setting —
# this repo is worked on from both Mac and Windows machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings in these.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
